flowchart LR
    Old[旧调用方\ntoken + /account/*]
    New[新前端与文档\nsessionId + /accounts/*]
    Ctrl[AccountController/AuthController\n兼容新老参数与路径]
    Adapter[SessionValidator\n解析 sessionId 优先\ntoken 仅兼容别名]
    Token[TokenManager\n维护会话和 cardNo 映射]
    Service[Account/Auth/Transaction Service\n只接收统一后的 cardNo 或请求 DTO]
    Result[Result<T>\ncode/message/data/timestamp]

    Old --> Ctrl
    New --> Ctrl
    Ctrl --> Adapter --> Token
    Adapter --> Service --> Result
